# 🌐 Crawl4AI MCP Server  
**The Ultimate Web Crawling Power-Up for Claude Desktop**  

![Crawl4AI MCP](https://img.shields.io/badge/Crawl4AI-MCP-blue) 
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green) 
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10%2B-blue)  

Turn Claude into a web-crawling superhero 🦸 with this Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that harnesses the power of `crawl4ai` for intelligent content extraction.

---

## 🚀 Features That Pack a Punch  

✔ **Precision Extraction** - Grab exactly what you need from any webpage with natural language commands  
✔ **Markdown Magic** - Get clean, structured markdown from messy web content  
✔ **Link Vacuum** - Suck up every link on a page in seconds  
✔ **Table Transformer** - Convert HTML tables to pristine JSON with perfect formatting  
✔ **Multi-Site Mayhem** - Crawl dozens of sites simultaneously without breaking a sweat  
✔ **Real-Time Results** - Stream processed content as it's being crawled  

---

## ⚡ Quick Start  

### Prerequisites  
- Python 3.10+ (because we like shiny new things)  
- Claude Desktop (your AI sidekick)  
- `crawl4ai` (v0.6.0+) - the engine under the hood  

### One-Command Setup  
```bash
git clone https://github.com/OnsioAS/crawl4ai-mcp.git && cd crawl4ai-mcp
chmod +x setup.sh && ./setup.sh  # Let the magic happen
```

The setup wizard will:  
✨ Create a cozy Python virtual environment  
📦 Install all the necessary gear  
⚙️ Automatically configure Claude Desktop  

---

## 🛠️ Supercharge Your Claude  

After installation, try these power moves:  

```claude
"Analyze example.com and give me the 3 most important takeaways"
"Extract the CEO's bio from about-us page as markdown"
"Compare pricing tables from stripe.com, paddle.com, and fastspring.com"
"Find all research papers linked from ai-research.org"
```

---

## 🔧 Tool Arsenal  

| Tool | Command | What It Does |  
|------|---------|--------------|  
| **Surgical Extraction** | `crawl_page` | Pinpoint content with NLP instructions |  
| **Link Hoover** | `get_page_links` | Vacuum up every URL on a page |  
| **Table Whisperer** | `extract_table_as_json` | Convert HTML tables to perfect JSON |  
| **Parallel Crawler** | `crawl_many` | Crush multiple sites at once |  
| **Stream Mode** | `crawl_many_streaming` | Get real-time drip-feed results |  

---

## 🚨 Troubleshooting  

**🐍 Python Path Problems?**  
Edit your config to point to the right Python (we all get lost sometimes)  

**🛑 Getting Blocked?**  
Try different user agents - some sites are shy about crawlers  

**💥 Memory Crashing?**  
Dial down `max_concurrency` - even superheroes have limits  

Test your setup with:  
```bash
./test_server.py  # Should return 🎉 if working
```

